00:04:58.164 --> 00:05:01.034 align:start size:94% position:6%
Just be careful."
[ Laughter ]

00:05:01.034 --> 00:05:04.370 size:88% position:44%
So, they started me on
anti-anxiety medication,

00:05:04.370 --> 00:05:07.240
'cause you tend to have anxiety
