Thank you.

00:05:14.714 --> 00:05:17.083 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:05:17.083 --> 00:05:18.117 line:92%
But it made me wet the bed.

00:05:18.117 --> 00:05:20.186 size:84% position:42%
It made me wet the bed,
so I stopped taking it,

00:05:20.186 --> 00:05:22.555
