00:05:39.439 --> 00:05:41.674 size:84% position:42%
You guys are fantastic.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:41.674 --> 00:05:44.844
Thank you so much. You guys
are the best. Thank you.

00:05:44.844 --> 00:05:47.447 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
